==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is pretty easy, so just meatshield and spawn [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat/Macho Leg Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat/King Dragon Cat]] to win. Add in [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat/Cyborg Cat]] if you have it.

